<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was at a near standstill in the panhandle area late Tuesday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not well tested at the close.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers. 34,000 head confirmed for the week to date including 29,500 formulated cattle to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Heifers - small pen select, few choice 2-3 1100 lbs 65.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:	100     Week Ago: 46,200    Year Ago:  44,100</p>
<p>Wk to Date:  34,100     Week Ago: 72,800    Year Ago: 107,900</p>
